"author": "Honza Bambas \u003chonzab.moz@firemni.cz\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1550498. r=kershaw, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D30510", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpConnectionMgr.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpHandler.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "e1b92ba4fb111b004106a333135f6481bc14582d", "parents": ["8546c7f9d94624c7ea20096c0712b6dd76c86a03"], "tags": []}], "date": 1562012953, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "455": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jeff Gilbert \u003cjgilbert@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1533522 - Truncate Buffer/Texture on GL_OOM. r=lsalzman, a=RyanVM", "files": ["dom/canvas/WebGLBuffer.cpp", "dom/canvas/WebGLRenderbuffer.cpp", "dom/canvas/WebGLTexture.cpp", "dom/canvas/WebGLTexture.h", "dom/canvas/WebGLTextureUpload.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d815b20659daed17b1783c38a1f136222469d963", "parents": ["e1b92ba4fb111b004106a333135f6481bc14582d"], "tags": []}], "date": 1562030950, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "456": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mark Hammond \u003cmhammond@skippinet.com.au\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1538015 (part 1) - test only change to tighten up the checks being made. r=tcsc, a=RyanVM\n\nThis is a test-only change to make the existing synced prefs tests more\nexplicit about values being checked and moves a couple of prefs around to make\nthings a bit clearer, which should make the test changes in part 2 clearer.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D29774", "files": ["services/sync/tests/unit/test_prefs_store.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "9d066208192089152b2f58379e6acd3e5360c242", "parents": ["d815b20659daed17b1783c38a1f136222469d963"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mark Hammond \u003cmhammond@skippinet.com.au\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1538015 (part 2) - restrict when incoming synced prefs are applied. r=tcsc,pauljt,Gijs, a=RyanVM\n\nSpecifically, a \"control pref\" for a pref must already exist locally, or\na new preference, `services.sync.prefs.dangerously_allow_arbitrary` must\nbe set to true.\n\nThis also removes a few preferences from the set we sync by default based\ndue to potential harm which can be caused syncing inappropriate values.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D29775", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js", "services/sync/modules/engines/prefs.js", "services/sync/tests/unit/test_engine_changes_during_sync.js", "services/sync/tests/unit/test_prefs_store.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "cbdd37ea216336ed423014d5607a8a26dfece5a8", "parents": ["9d066208192089152b2f58379e6acd3e5360c242"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew Swan \u003caswan@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1539598 - Require pre-install confirmation on all addons installs from outside about:addons. r=kmag, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D26024", "files": ["toolkit/mozapps/extensions/AddonManager.jsm", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/test/browser/browser_webapi_install.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "cc2fe419273435137188f5aeb5025d10a02fafe2", "parents": ["cbdd37ea216336ed423014d5607a8a26dfece5a8"], "tags": ["FIREFOX_60_8_0esr_BUILD1", "FIREFOX_60_8_0esr_RELEASE"]}], "date": 1562105184, "git_changesets": [null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}}
}";